<title>USA: NutraGenics names financial officer.</title>
<headline>NutraGenics names financial officer.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>NutraGenics Inc said Thursday it named George Duck to the new position of executive vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Duck was most recently vice president and chief financial officer of Coca-Cola Bottling of New York Inc.</p>
